Kosha Capture (browser extension)

Parts of this extension are ported from or modelled on twitter-web-exporter
by prinsss, https://github.com/prinsss/twitter-web-exporter, used under the
MIT License:

  - src/x/inpage.ts: the XMLHttpRequest.prototype.open hook
    (from src/core/extensions/manager.ts)
  - src/x/match.ts: the bookmark request match and the path to the timeline
    instructions (from src/modules/bookmarks/api.ts)

The tweet parsers in its src/utils/api.ts are not included here; Kosha parses
the raw responses on its server.

